## State Management

### Local State (Default)
Use `StatefulComponent` with `setState()` for:
- Form inputs and validation
- UI toggles and local interactions
- Component-specific state

### Global State (Riverpod)
```dart
// Add: dart pub add jaspr_riverpod
final userProvider = StateProvider<User?>((ref) => null);

class UserProfile extends ConsumerWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {
    final user = ref.watch(userProvider);
    return div([
      if (user != null) text('Welcome, ${user.name}'),
    ]);
  }
}
```

## Testing Strategy
```dart
// test/components/my_component_test.dart
import 'package:jaspr_test/jaspr_test.dart';
import 'package:test/test.dart';

void main() {
  group('MyComponent', () {
    testComponents('renders correctly', (tester) async {
      await tester.pumpComponent(MyComponent(data: testData));
      expect(find.text('Expected Text'), findsOneComponent);
    });

    testComponents('handles user interaction', (tester) async {
      await tester.pumpComponent(MyComponent(data: testData));
      await tester.tap(find.byText('Click Me'));
      await tester.pump();
      expect(find.text('Clicked!'), findsOneComponent);
    });
  });
}
```

## Deployment

### Static Sites (Recommended)
```bash
jaspr build
# Deploy build/jaspr/ to:
# - Netlify: Drag & drop
# - Vercel: Git integration
# - GitHub Pages: Actions workflow
```

### Server Deployment
```bash
jaspr build --target exe
# Deploy executable + web/ assets to server
```

## Common Issues & Solutions

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Hot reload not working | Check syntax errors, restart `jaspr serve` |
| CSS not loading | Verify `@css` syntax, run `jaspr clean` |
| Build failures | Check Dart SDK >=3.0, run `dart pub get` |
| Color.hex() deprecated | Use `Color(0xFF...)` constructor |
| Position API errors | Use `.absolute(top: 0.px)` with parameters |
| Grid layout issues | Use `GridTemplate` with `GridTracks` |

## Performance Best Practices
- Use `const` constructors everywhere possible
- Implement semantic HTML for accessibility
- Optimize images and assets
- Leverage server-side rendering for SEO
- Use proper loading states and error boundaries
- Minimize client-side JavaScript

## Essential Packages
- `jaspr_router` - Routing system
- `jaspr_test` - Testing utilities  
- `jaspr_riverpod` - Global state management
- `http` - API calls
- `json_annotation` - JSON serialization

